@startuml
[*] --> ApplicationStart

ApplicationStart --> AddingExpense : Add Expense
ApplicationStart --> EditingExpense : Edit Expense
ApplicationStart --> ViewingExpenses : View/Search Expenses

AddingExpense --> ExpenseSaved : Save
AddingExpense --> ApplicationStart : Cancel

EditingExpense --> ExpenseUpdated : Update
EditingExpense --> ApplicationStart : Cancel

ViewingExpenses --> GeneratingReport : Generate Report
ViewingExpenses --> ReceivingReminder : Receive Reminder
ViewingExpenses --> ApplicationStart : Return to Start

GeneratingReport --> ReportGenerated : Generate
GeneratingReport --> ViewingExpenses : Cancel

ReceivingReminder --> ReminderAcknowledged : Acknowledge
ReceivingReminder --> ViewingExpenses : Dismiss

ApplicationStart --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
